# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local editor/assistant scratch files are excluded per-clone via
# .git/info/exclude, not here. Naming them in a tracked file would defeat
# docs/adr/0003-neutral-repository-documentation.md - to ignore a name you have
# to write it down, and .gitignore is tracked. The ADR explains the setup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

